# Cloudflare Pages cache-control (also respected by most other static hosts
# that support a similar convention). None of this app's files use
# content-hashed filenames, so anything cached with a long max-age would go
# stale the moment you redeploy a change — the browser just keeps serving
# the old copy until the cache expires. `no-cache` here doesn't mean
# "don't cache" — it means "always revalidate with the server first" (a
# cheap 304 Not Modified when nothing changed), which is what actually
# prevents the app-shell/service-worker version-mismatch bugs that come
# from over-caching un-hashed files. Only truly static, rarely-changed
# assets (icons) get a real cache lifetime.

# Security headers, applied to every response. CSP is the main one worth
# explaining: NOMINATIM_URL/VALHALLA_URL/MAP_STYLE_URL/OTP2_URL/Mapillary are
# all user-configurable to an arbitrary self-hosted host (see config.js), so
# connect-src/img-src stay open to any https origin rather than an allowlist
# that would break the moment you point this at your own server. script-src
# is still origin-restricted to only this site plus unpkg.com (MapLibre/Turf,
# pinned + SRI-checked — see index.html), no plugins/objects can be embedded
# at all, and there's no inline script anywhere in the app for 'unsafe-eval'
# to matter much in practice — but 'unsafe-eval' itself IS required: Turf.js's
# UMD bundle calls `new Function(...)` in its own module-environment-detection
# bootstrap (confirmed by testing — the map fails to load without it), not
# anything this app's own code does.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval' https://unpkg.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://unpkg.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https:; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/app.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/config.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/idb.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/native-location.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/style.css
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
